								<h2 class="module-title"><span class="title">UAMS Health News</span></h2>
							</div>
							<div class="col-12">
								<div class="card-list card-list-left">
																			<div class="item" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/NewsArticle">
											<div class="card">
																									<div class="card-img-top">
														<picture>
																															<img decoding="async" src="https://news.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Hospital-exterior-nite-1-512x288.jpg" alt="UAMS more than $5 million in funding under the HEART and RISE ARKANSAS initiatives of the Arkansas Rural Health Transformation Program (RHTP)." itemprop="url">
																														</picture>
													</div>
																								<div class="card-body">
													<h3 class="card-title h5" itemprop="headline">Arkansas Rural Health Transformation Program Awards UAMS $5 Million to Fund 6 Initiatives</h3>
													<p>LITTLE ROCK — The University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences (UAMS) received more than $5 million in funding under the HEART and RISE ARKANSAS initiatives of the Arkansas Rural Health Transformation Program (RHTP).</p>
<div></div>													<!-- <p class="card-text" itemprop="articleBody"></p> -->
													<a href="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/24/arkansas-rural-health-transformation-program-awards-uams-5-million-to-fund-6-initiatives/" class="btn btn-primary stretched-link" aria-label="Arkansas Rural Health Transformation Program Awards UAMS $5 Million to Fund 6 Initiatives" itemprop="url" data-moduletitle="UAMS Health News" data-categorytitle="">Read more</a>
												</div>
											</div>
											<span class="news-item-byline-author" itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="Yavonda Chase"/>
											</span>
											<meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-09-24T15:21:56+00:00"/>
											<meta itemprop="dateModified" content="2026-09-24T15:21:56+00:00"/>
											<span itemprop="publisher" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Organization">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences"/>
												<span itemprop="logo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject">
													<meta itemprop="url" content="http://web.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/51/2017/09/UAMS_Academic_40-1.png"/>
													<meta itemprop="width" content="297"/>
													<meta itemprop="height" content="40"/>
												</span>
											</span>
											<meta itemscope itemprop="mainEntityOfPage"  itemType="https://schema.org/WebPage" itemid="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/24/arkansas-rural-health-transformation-program-awards-uams-5-million-to-fund-6-initiatives/"/>
										</div>
																			<div class="item" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/NewsArticle">
											<div class="card">
																									<div class="card-img-top">
														<picture>
																															<img decoding="async" src="https://news.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Hellou-Myeloma-Center-Logo-512x288.png" alt="Tamer Hellou" itemprop="url">
																														</picture>
													</div>
																								<div class="card-body">
													<h3 class="card-title h5" itemprop="headline">Hematologist Tamer Hellou, M.D., Joins UAMS Myeloma Center</h3>
													<p>Hematologist Tamer Hellou, M.D., has joined the University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences (UAMS) Winthrop P. Rockefeller Cancer Institute’s Myeloma Center.</p>
<div></div>													<!-- <p class="card-text" itemprop="articleBody"></p> -->
													<a href="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/22/hematologist-tamer-hellou-m-d-joins-uams-myeloma-center/" class="btn btn-primary stretched-link" aria-label="Hematologist Tamer Hellou, M.D., Joins UAMS Myeloma Center" itemprop="url" data-moduletitle="UAMS Health News" data-categorytitle="">Read more</a>
												</div>
											</div>
											<span class="news-item-byline-author" itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="Nathan Tidwell"/>
											</span>
											<meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-09-22T10:24:21+00:00"/>
											<meta itemprop="dateModified" content="2026-09-22T15:32:19+00:00"/>
											<span itemprop="publisher" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Organization">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences"/>
												<span itemprop="logo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject">
													<meta itemprop="url" content="http://web.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/51/2017/09/UAMS_Academic_40-1.png"/>
													<meta itemprop="width" content="297"/>
													<meta itemprop="height" content="40"/>
												</span>
											</span>
											<meta itemscope itemprop="mainEntityOfPage"  itemType="https://schema.org/WebPage" itemid="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/22/hematologist-tamer-hellou-m-d-joins-uams-myeloma-center/"/>
										</div>
																			<div class="item" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/NewsArticle">
											<div class="card">
																									<div class="card-img-top">
														<picture>
																															<img decoding="async" src="https://news.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_4376-512x288.jpg" alt="Scott and Jo Rampy cut the ribbon for the new UAMS Health MS Clinic in Fayetteville." itemprop="url">
																														</picture>
													</div>
																								<div class="card-body">
													<h3 class="card-title h5" itemprop="headline">UAMS Celebrates Opening of Multiple Sclerosis Clinic in Fayetteville</h3>
													<p>FAYETTEVILLE — The University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences (UAMS) held a ribbon-cutting ceremony Sept. 18 to celebrate the opening of the UAMS Health MS Clinic, located at the UAMS Northwest Regional Campus in Fayetteville.</p>
<div></div>													<!-- <p class="card-text" itemprop="articleBody"></p> -->
													<a href="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/18/uams-celebrates-opening-of-multiple-sclerosis-clinic-in-fayetteville/" class="btn btn-primary stretched-link" aria-label="UAMS Celebrates Opening of Multiple Sclerosis Clinic in Fayetteville" itemprop="url" data-moduletitle="UAMS Health News" data-categorytitle="Medical News">Read more</a>
												</div>
											</div>
											<span class="news-item-byline-author" itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="Andrew Vogler"/>
											</span>
											<meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-09-18T13:12:44+00:00"/>
											<meta itemprop="dateModified" content="2026-09-18T14:51:35+00:00"/>
											<span itemprop="publisher" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Organization">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences"/>
												<span itemprop="logo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject">
													<meta itemprop="url" content="http://web.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/51/2017/09/UAMS_Academic_40-1.png"/>
													<meta itemprop="width" content="297"/>
													<meta itemprop="height" content="40"/>
												</span>
											</span>
											<meta itemscope itemprop="mainEntityOfPage"  itemType="https://schema.org/WebPage" itemid="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/18/uams-celebrates-opening-of-multiple-sclerosis-clinic-in-fayetteville/"/>
										</div>
																			<div class="item" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/NewsArticle">
											<div class="card">
																									<div class="card-img-top">
														<picture>
																															<img decoding="async" src="https://news.uams.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iStock-513115726-scaled-512x288.jpg" alt="An older man smiles as he&#039;s having his blood pressure measured by a woman in this stock image." itemprop="url">
																														</picture>
													</div>
																								<div class="card-body">
													<h3 class="card-title h5" itemprop="headline">UAMS Donald W. Reynolds Institute on Aging to Host Geriatric Care Conference on Oct. 1-3</h3>
													<p>The University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences (UAMS) will host its 2026 Geriatrics Updates conference Oct. 1-3, providing an opportunity for health professionals, patients, caregivers, and community members to learn about the latest developments in research and clinical care for older adults. </p>
<div></div>													<!-- <p class="card-text" itemprop="articleBody"></p> -->
													<a href="https://news.uams.edu/2026/09/16/uams-donald-w-reynolds-institute-on-aging-to-host-geriatric-care-conference-on-oct-1-3/" class="btn btn-primary stretched-link" aria-label="UAMS Donald W. Reynolds Institute on Aging to Host Geriatric Care Conference on Oct. 1-3" itemprop="url" data-moduletitle="UAMS Health News" data-categorytitle="Medical News">Read more</a>
												</div>
											</div>
											<span class="news-item-byline-author" itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="Chris Carmody"/>
											</span>
											<meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-09-16T09:33:28+00:00"/>
											<meta itemprop="dateModified" content="2026-09-16T09:35:58+00:00"/>
											<span itemprop="publisher" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Organization">
												<meta itemprop="name" content="University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences"/>
